---
// Componente Hero Institucional con fondo de terreno real nítido, animación escalonada y badge sirena
---

<section id="hero" class="relative min-h-[94vh] flex items-center justify-center pt-24 pb-20 overflow-hidden bg-slate-950 text-white">
  <!-- Real Deposit Background Image: High-res (2181x930) & Balanced Contrast -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0 overflow-hidden pointer-events-none">
    <img
      src="/assets/adriano/Foto Portada.png"
      alt="Macizo Geológico del Proyecto Adriano"
      class="w-full h-full object-cover object-center scale-100 filter brightness-85 contrast-110"
      loading="eager"
    />
    <!-- Refined Gradient Overlays with Deep Financial Navy Blue Tint -->
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#061224]/85 via-[#0B2144]/55 to-[#050E1C]/95"></div>
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#0F2D5C]/25 mix-blend-color pointer-events-none"></div>
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-radial from-[#0A2246]/45 via-transparent to-transparent"></div>
    <!-- Fine Grid Overlay -->
    <div
      class="absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.08] pointer-events-none"
      style="background-image: radial-gradient(#38BDF8 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 36px 36px;"
    ></div>
  </div>

  <div class="relative z-10 max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
    <!-- 1. Confidentiality Badge (Fondo transparente, letras amarillas y contorno amarillo con respiración sutil) -->
    <div
      data-animate="fade-up"
      data-delay="100"
      class="inline-block mb-7"
    >
      <div class="siren-badge inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full border text-[11px] font-extrabold tracking-wider uppercase bg-transparent transition-all duration-300">
        <!-- Amber/Yellow Light Indicator -->
        <span class="relative flex h-2.5 w-2.5 shrink-0">
          <span class="siren-beacon-ping absolute inline-flex h-full w-full rounded-full opacity-75"></span>
          <span class="siren-beacon-dot relative inline-flex rounded-full h-2.5 w-2.5"></span>
        </span>
        <i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved text-[11px]"></i>
        <span>Estrictamente Confidencial · Exclusivo para Inversionistas Calificados</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 2. Display Main Heading (Delay 300ms) -->
    <h1
      data-animate="fade-up"
      data-delay="300"
      class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight leading-[1.15] mb-5 font-['Plus_Jakarta_Sans'] drop-shadow-md"
    >
      Metales Estratégicos &<br class="hidden sm:inline" />
      <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-200 via-amber-400 to-amber-500">
        Tierras Raras Adriano
      </span>
    </h1>

    <!-- 3. Positioning Subtitle (Delay 500ms) -->
    <p
      data-animate="fade-up"
      data-delay="500"
      class="text-lg sm:text-2xl font-bold text-amber-400 tracking-normal mb-6 max-w-3xl mx-auto drop-shadow-sm"
    >
      El Activo Mineral de Origen Mantélico Más Relevante de la Década
    </p>

    <!-- 4. Contextualization Paragraph (Delay 700ms) -->
    <p
      data-animate="fade-up"
      data-delay="700"
      class="text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-200 max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed mb-10 font-medium drop-shadow-xs"
    >
      Oportunidad de inversión exclusiva en uno de los yacimientos minerales más extraordinarios jamás identificados: una formación ofiolítica de <strong class="text-white font-bold underline decoration-amber-500/60 underline-offset-4">2.328 hectáreas</strong> en el norte de Perú, que <strong class="text-white font-bold">contiene 41 metales estratégicos</strong> con acceso directo en superficie y a solo 75 km del Puerto de Salaverry.
    </p>

    <!-- 5. Dual Primary Call to Actions (Delay 900ms) -->
    <div
      data-animate="fade-up"
      data-delay="900"
      class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center items-center gap-4 mb-14"
    >
      <a
        href="#elementos"
        class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-amber-600 hover:from-amber-600 hover:to-amber-700 text-slate-950 font-extrabold text-sm px-8 py-4 rounded-xl shadow-xl hover:shadow-amber-500/25 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 active:scale-95 border border-amber-400/50"
      >
        <i class="fa-solid fa-atom text-xs"></i>
        <span>Explorar los 41 Elementos</span>
      </a>

      <a
        href="#contacto"
        class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2.5 bg-slate-900/90 hover:bg-slate-800 text-white font-semibold text-sm px-7 py-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-600 hover:border-amber-400/60 transition-all backdrop-blur-md active:scale-95 shadow-md"
      >
        <i class="fa-solid fa-calendar-check text-amber-400 text-xs"></i>
        <span>Agenda una reunión con el equipo directivo</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- 6. Certified Labs & Validation Ribbon (Delay 1100ms) -->
    <div
      data-animate="fade-up"
      data-delay="1100"
      class="pt-7 border-t border-slate-800/90 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-5 text-xs text-slate-300"
    >
      <span class="uppercase tracking-wider font-extrabold text-slate-400 text-[10px]">
        Validación Analítica Independiente (15 Estudios · 2004–2022):
      </span>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-6 font-semibold text-slate-200">
        <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-amber-400 text-[10px]"></i>
          ACTLABS (Canadá)
        </span>
        <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-amber-400 text-[10px]"></i>
          ALS-Chemex (Vancouver)
        </span>
        <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-amber-400 text-[10px]"></i>
          SGS del Perú
        </span>
        <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-slate-800/90 border border-slate-700 text-amber-300 text-[11px] font-bold">
          Ensayos ICP-MS & LGR
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  /* =========================================================================
     YELLOW CONFIDENTIALITY BADGE (Fondo 100% transparente, letras y borde amarillos)
     ========================================================================= */
  @keyframes badge-gentle-amber-loop {
    0%, 100% {
      background-color: transparent;
      color: #FACC15; /* yellow-400 */
      border-color: rgba(250, 204, 21, 0.75);
      box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(250, 204, 21, 0.15);
    }
    50% {
      background-color: transparent; /* Fondo siempre transparente */
      color: #FDE047; /* yellow-300: pulso sutil y luminoso */
      border-color: rgba(253, 224, 71, 0.95);
      box-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(250, 204, 21, 0.35);
    }
  }

  @keyframes beacon-amber-pulse {
    0%, 100% {
      transform: scale(0.95);
      opacity: 0.85;
    }
    50% {
      transform: scale(1.1);
      opacity: 1;
    }
  }

  .siren-badge {
    background-color: transparent !important;
    animation: badge-gentle-amber-loop 6.5s infinite ease-in-out;
  }

  .siren-beacon-dot {
    background-color: #FACC15;
    animation: beacon-amber-pulse 6.5s infinite ease-in-out;
  }

  .siren-beacon-ping {
    background-color: #FACC15;
    animation: ping 2.8s cubic-bezier(0, 0, 0.2, 1) infinite;
  }
</style>
